content.text:
Hey, just wanted to update you—we ended up doing both! We upgraded betterleaks from 1.5.0 to 1.8.0, which improved performance quite a bit, and added goredact as a selectable scanner.

Both are available in today’s nightly (`brew install --cask entire@nightly`). To use goredact instead, add this to `.entire/settings.json`:

```json
"redaction": {
  "betterleaks": { "enabled": false },
  "goredact": { "enabled": true }
}
```

Thanks again for sharing it!

